<title>BELGIUM: EU publishes 97/98 grain export tender details.</title>
<headline>EU publishes 97/98 grain export tender details.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union published regulations for 1997/98 (July/June) common wheat, barley and rye export tenders, paving the way for the first adjudication of bids on Thursday, European Commission officials said.</p>
<p>In EU Official Journal L 184, the Commission defined details for tendering for refunds or taxes to export the grain to non-EU countries.</p>
<p>The EU cereals management committee agreed on July 3 to open the export tenders but this could not be implemented until the regulations had been published.</p>
<p>However, opening of the EU tenders is not expected to lead to a rush of exports.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
